---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../components/QuoteForm.astro';
import PhoneCTA from '../../components/PhoneCTA.astro';
import SchemaMarkup from '../../components/SchemaMarkup.astro';
import { config } from '../../config';

const title = 'Legal Courier & Court Filings | Nanaimo BC';
const description = 'Same-day legal document delivery and court filing service. Nanaimo courthouse expertise. Certified proof of delivery, deadline-conscious dispatch.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <SchemaMarkup type="Service" data={{ serviceName: 'Legal Courier & Court Filings', description }} />

  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-brand-blue to-brand-dark text-white py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="section-container">
      <h1 class="text-white mb-4">Legal Courier & Court Filings</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl opacity-95 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
        Same-day legal document delivery across Nanaimo and Vancouver Island. We know Nanaimo courthouse procedures, filing deadlines, and security protocols.
      </p>
      <PhoneCTA text={`Call Now: ${config.phone}`} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Legal Services We Provide</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="text-brand-blue mb-3">Courthouse Filing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Deadline-critical document filing at Nanaimo courthouse. We know filing windows, security procedures, and court clerk expectations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="text-brand-blue mb-3">Law Firm Delivery</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Inter-office courier, client document delivery, urgent legal materials. Discrete, professional handling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="text-brand-blue mb-3">Deposition Materials</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Transport of deposition files, evidence binders, and sensitive legal materials. Chain-of-custody if required.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="text-brand-blue mb-3">Notary & Affidavit Runs</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Pick up signed affidavits from clients and deliver to notary or courthouse. Same-day certification support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-blue-50 section-container">
    <h2>Nanaimo Courthouse Filing: What We Know</h2>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
      Our drivers are familiar with Nanaimo courthouse operations:
    </p>

    <ul class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-gray-700">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Filing windows:</strong> Most civil documents 9 AM–4 PM. Criminal urgent motions by 11 AM or next-day filing. We know the cutoffs.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Security:</strong> No weapons, ID required. Our drivers respect courthouse protocols and move quickly.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Service of documents:</strong> We can facilitate proper service on opposing counsel if needed (local address on file).</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Proof of filing:</strong> We return your file stamps, exhibit stamps, and can photograph proof for your records.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Same-day turnaround:</strong> Pickup from your office, courthouse filing, and proof back to you by 5 PM on most days.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Why Law Firms Choose Us</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">No Excuses on Deadlines</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          We understand that a blown filing deadline can trigger sanctions, malpractice claims, or worse. Your deadline is our deadline. We track it, we hit it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Local Expertise</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Our drivers know Nanaimo courthouse staff, parking, and security. No "where do I go?" delays. One call, and we're there in 30 minutes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Confidentiality</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Legal work is sensitive. We treat all materials as confidential. No questions about content, no casual handling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Proof of Delivery</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Every legal delivery includes timestamp, photo, and signature. If needed, we can certify the time and manner of filing for court records.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 section-container">
    <h2>Legal Courier Pricing</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Transparent pricing for legal work. Standard rates apply, with priority handling for deadline-driven deliveries:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded border border-gray-300 mb-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="pb-3 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Nanaimo Courthouse Filing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$35 flat rate (includes parking, filing desk navigation, and proof return)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-3 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Downtown Law Firm Delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$18 base + $1.50/km (standard same-day rate)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-3 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Island Routes (Victoria, Comox)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$35 base + $2.00/km (ferry and distance factor)</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Urgent/Rush Priority</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">+50% on any rate if ordered with less than 1 hour to deadline</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6">
        High-volume law firms? Monthly retainer accounts available. We'll discuss your volume, and we can optimize.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <QuoteForm />

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Nanaimo Courthouse Filing Procedure: What We Handle</h2>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
      We know Nanaimo courthouse operations inside-out. Here's exactly how we handle your filings:
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Step 1: You Call with Filing Details</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          You call us with: file name, number of copies, filing type (civil motion, criminal urgent, family application, etc.), and deadline. You tell us pickup address and courthouse filing location. We confirm we can meet the deadline based on courthouse hours and ferry (if Victoria).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Step 2: We Pickup from Your Law Office</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Our driver arrives at your office, verifies document bundle (number of pages, exhibits, cover sheets), and confirms filing fee is included or to be paid at courthouse. Driver scans & photographs the bundle for your records, signs manifest, and you keep a copy. Real-time pickup tracking begins.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Step 3: Delivery to Nanaimo Courthouse</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Driver proceeds to Nanaimo Courthouse (250 Wallace Street). Parking is in the municipal lot behind the building. Driver enters security (ID required, no weapons), proceeds to Civil/Criminal counter (depending on filing type), and hands documents to the court clerk on duty. Clerk processes filing, stamps all copies, and records the filing time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Step 4: Proof of Filing Returned</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Court returns stamped copies to our driver (or files are held for your pickup). Driver photographs file stamps and receipt (showing date/time of filing), and returns to your office with the certified copies. You receive stamped documents same day, proof of filing in hand.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Step 5: Email Confirmation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Within 1 hour, you receive email with: proof-of-filing photo, filing timestamp, court receipt (if provided), and driver confirmation. Audit trail complete for your file.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-blue-50 section-container">
    <h2>Nanaimo Courthouse Key Facts</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Filing Hours</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm"><strong>Civil:</strong> 9 AM–4 PM weekdays. <strong>Criminal:</strong> 9 AM–4 PM weekdays. Urgent motions by 11 AM or next-day filing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Location & Parking</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">250 Wallace Street, Nanaimo. Parking: Municipal lot behind courthouse. Our drivers know the drill—no delays.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Document Requirements</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Original + 2 copies standard (verify court rules for your filing type). Affidavits must be notarized. Exhibits clearly labeled.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">After-Hours Filings</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Courthouse closes 4 PM. After-hours filings go to next-day intake. Emergency? Call for availability and rush charges (+$100–$200 depending on severity).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Filing Fees</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">We don't pay court fees—you provide payment method (cash, check, credit card when applicable). Court processes fee at counter. We transport and file; you manage payment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Multi-Stop Filings</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Courthouse + opposing counsel delivery + notary stop = one route. We optimize and provide single invoice. Saves you coordination time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Island Routes: Victoria Courthouse & Others</h2>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
      Beyond Nanaimo, we serve Vancouver Island courts. Key details:
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Victoria Courthouse (BC Court of Appeal, Supreme Court)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          <strong>Filing Hours:</strong> 9 AM–4 PM weekdays. <strong>Turnaround:</strong> Nanaimo pickup by 9 AM, filing by 1 PM, return to you by 3 PM (ferry route). <strong>Cost:</strong> $50 base + $2.00/km + $25 ferry surcharge (~$150–$180 typical). <strong>Deadline critical?</strong> Call by 8 AM to confirm ferry schedule and timing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Parksville & Comox (Local Courts)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Smaller facilities; same-day filing available. Less traffic than Nanaimo/Victoria. Cutoff time: 2 PM. Turnaround: 2–3 hours. Cost: ~$80–$120.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Legal Courier FAQ</h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 max-w-3xl">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Can you file a motion that's due this morning?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Call us immediately. If courthouse filing hasn't closed yet (4 PM), we can rush-pick from your office and file. Rush charges apply (+$50–$100), but if time allows, we get it done. No guarantees after 3 PM cutoff.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Do you serve documents on opposing counsel?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          We can hand-deliver to local law firms and businesses. For formal legal service of documents, you'll need a process server (different service). But for routine inter-counsel delivery, we handle it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">What if the courthouse has moved or hours changed?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          We stay current on BC court procedures. That said, courthouses sometimes change. Always confirm the filing address and hours with your legal team. We'll double-check with you before dispatch if you ask.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Can you handle multiple stops in one trip?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes. Courthouse filing + law firm pickup + notary office = one efficient route. We'll optimize stops and provide a single invoice. Saves you coordination headache.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Do you do after-hours emergency filings?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Nanaimo Courthouse closes at 4 PM. After-hours filings are queued for next-day intake. True emergency? Call for after-hours rates (+$100–$200) and limited availability. We try, but no guarantee.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">What's your proof of filing? Can I show it to the court?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes. We provide stamped copies (returned from court), timestamp photos, and filing receipt. Your attorney can reference in correspondence. Not a substitute for official court records, but proof you filed on time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
